        "factor": "Measurement/counting uncertainty",
        "direction": "neutral",
        "magnitude": "weak",
        "rationale": "Short-window fluctuations and snapshot timing can swing counts by small amounts; this introduces some calibration noise but is unlikely to completely reverse the near-term trend."
