    "synthesis_rationale": "Starting from the anchor probability (0.65), multiple near-term up-factors push the probability higher, while counting noise and correlations temper the impact. The factors are moderately correlated (growth pace and market signals both reflect similar underlying momentum), so the calibration yields a high posterior probability (0.92) with a relatively narrow uncertainty band (0.85–0.97)."
